# File & Component Structure

## Max File Size
- No file should exceed **200 lines of code**. 
- If it does, break it into reusable, well-named components.

## Reusable Components
- Whenever a UI pattern is reused, create a component. 
- Refactor inline usage across the app to adopt it.

## Imports
- Always ensure required modules are imported explicitly. 
- No "undefined" errors should ever appear due to missing imports.

## Dark/Light Theme
- All new UI must support both light and dark themes unless explicitly documented otherwise.

## Responsiveness
- All layouts, headers, and navigation elements must be **fully responsive and mobile-friendly**. 
- Ensure smooth, professional transitions between breakpoints. 
- Use Tailwind responsive utilities effectively.
